# ========================================
# 统一认证中心 — 接口测试
# ========================================
# 使用前先启动应用 (端口 9000)
# 授权码流程的浏览器演示: 启动 oauth2-callback-web-app (node server.js, 端口 8080)
# ========================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000
@clientId = web-app
@clientSecret = 123456
@basicAuth = Basic d2ViLWFwcDoxMjM0NTY=

# ⚠️ 运行时变量 (从浏览器演示页面获取后填入)
@code = __CODE__
@accessToken = __ACCESS_TOKEN__
@refreshToken = __REFRESH_TOKEN__


# ========================================
# 1. 系统检查
# ========================================

### 1.1 健康检查 (MySQL + Redis 状态)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1.2 服务信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/info

### 1.3 OIDC 发现文档
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### 1.4 JWKS 公钥
GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth2/jwks


# ========================================
# 2. 授权码模式 (需先用浏览器演示页面获取 code)
# ========================================

### 2.1 用 code 换 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth2/token
Authorization: {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code={{code}}&redirect_uri=http://localhost:8080/callback

### 2.2 刷新 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth2/token
Authorization: {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}


# ========================================
# 3. 密码模式
# ========================================

### 3.1 用户名密码直接换 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth2/token
Authorization: {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=user&password=123456&scope=openid profile email read write


# ========================================
# 4. 资源服务 (通讯录 API, 需 Bearer Opaque Token)
# ========================================

### 4.1 查询通讯录 (填入 accessToken)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4.2 OIDC 用户信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4.3 令牌自省
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth2/introspect
Authorization: {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token={{accessToken}}&token_type_hint=access_token


# ========================================
# 5. 退出 (Token 吊销 + Session 销毁)
# ========================================
# 退出涉及两个独立动作, 互补使用:
#   ① /oauth2/revoke (RFC 7009): 仅吊销 token 本身, 不会销毁服务器端 HttpSession
#      → 适用于"换设备/换 token"场景, 不影响用户登录态
#   ② /logout: 销毁服务器端 PORTAL HttpSession, 让 JSESSIONID 失效
#      → 必须执行此步, 否则下次 /oauth2/authorize 会带着旧 session 自动登录, 看起来像"退出又自动登录回来"
# 客户端标准退出流程: 先调 revoke 吊销 token, 再跳 /logout 销毁 session, 最后回到登录页

### 5.1 吊销 access_token (RFC 7009, 成功一律返回 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth2/revoke
Authorization: {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token={{accessToken}}&token_type_hint=access_token

### 5.2 吊销 refresh_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth2/revoke
Authorization: {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token={{refreshToken}}&token_type_hint=refresh_token